1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,000
A flight through dense mist over sheer, icy mountain ridges.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:19,000
In darkness, blinding golden fire bursts from a jagged, horned emblem and expands outward.

3
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
A glowing horned warrior clutching a scythe emerges in the haze.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Two planetary spheres drift through amber clouds, then fade to black.

